==Squads==
{{main|2015 FIFA Club World Cup squads}}

Each team had to name a 23-man squad (three of whom had to be goalkeepers) by the FIFA deadline of 30 November 2015. The squads of six of the seven teams were released by FIFA on 3 December 2015 (except Sanfrecce Hiroshima, who only confirmed their place in the tournament on 5 December 2015).<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2015/m=12/news=squad-lists-released-for-club-world-cup-2741686.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20151203223136/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2015/m=12/news=squad-lists-released-for-club-world-cup-2741686.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=3 December 2015 |title=Squad lists released for Club World Cup |website=FIFA.com |date=3 December 2015}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.fifadata.com/document/FCWC/2015/pdf/FCWC_2015_SquadLists.pdf |title=FIFA Club World Cup Japan 2015 – Squad Lists |website=FIFA.com|access-date=6 December 2015|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20151211024602/http://fifadata.com/document/FCWC/2015/pdf/FCWC_2015_SquadLists.pdf|archive-date=11 December 2015|url-status=dead}}</ref> Injury replacements were allowed until 24 hours before the team's first match.<ref name="regulations"/>

==Matches==
The schedule of the tournament, together with the emblem, was unveiled on 24 August 2015.<ref name="ticketing">{{cite web |url=http://l-tike.com/fcwc2015-en/index.html |title=Tickets for the FIFA Club World Cup Japan 2015|access-date=24 August 2015|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150923163750/http://l-tike.com/fcwc2015-en/index.html|archive-date=23 September 2015|url-status=dead}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2015/m=8/news=japan-reveals-official-emblem-for-fifa-club-world-cup-2672132.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150825164725/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2015/m=8/news=japan-reveals-official-emblem-for-fifa-club-world-cup-2672132.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=25 August 2015 |title=Japan Reveals Official Emblem for FIFA Club World Cup |publisher=FIFA |date=24 August 2015}}</ref>

A draw was held on 23 September 2015, 14:00 [[Central European Summer Time|CEST]] ([[UTC+02:00|UTC+2]]), at the FIFA headquarters in [[Zürich]], [[Switzerland]], to determine the positions in the bracket for the three teams which enter the quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2015/m=9/news=the-draw-live-on-fifa-com-2692134.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150925023832/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2015/m=9/news=the-draw-live-on-fifa-com-2692134.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=25 September 2015 |title=The draw LIVE on FIFA.com |date=22 September 2015}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2015/m=9/news=draw-for-japan-2015-conducted-in-zurich-2695963.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150925114918/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2015/m=9/news=draw-for-japan-2015-conducted-in-zurich-2695963.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=25 September 2015 |title=Draw for Japan 2015 conducted in Zurich |publisher=FIFA |date=23 September 2015}}</ref>

If a match was tied after normal playing time:<ref name="regulations"/>
*For elimination matches, [[Overtime (sports)#Association football|extra time]] was played. If still tied after extra time, a [[Penalty shoot-out (association football)|penalty shoot-out]] was held to determine the winner.
*For the matches for fifth place and third place, no extra time was played, and a penalty shoot-out was held to determine the winner.

